WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Start at position 2 and move right. Where will five moves land?

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.200
Choose 5, then reveal the route.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.300
Move 1 lands at 3.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.400
Move 2 lands at 4.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.500
Move 3 lands at 5.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Move 4 reaches the wall at 6.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.040
Move 5 rebounds to position 5.
